      418.42,
      286.48,
      496.41
    ],
    "text": "I, hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 of the Land Acquisition Act as Amended by the land Acquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that the Government indents to acquire the following land which is required for a public purpose.",
