      376.8
    ],
    "text": "well; Name of the Claimed: Thavamani Shekspear No. 376, Galle Road, Colombo 03; Extent: 0.1656 Hectare.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.020000457763672
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      304.38,
      386.19,
      539.94,
      515.94
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands on which a servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing, before me at Divisional Secretariat, Vadamarachchi North/Point Pedro on the 28th Tuesday of April 2015 at 10.00 a.m. and are hereby requested to notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 21st day of April 2015 the nature of their interests in the land, the particular of their claims for compensation for the acquisition of the said land amount of compensation and the details of the computation of such amount.",
